{{!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  training/newsletter-widget.hbs — compact subscribe card for the training
  sidebar (sits under the curriculum rail on section + lesson pages).

  Same Ghost members form as the hero — `data-members-*` is wired by Ghost's
  Portal script, so this needs no theme JS.

  Ghost renders one Portal per page fine, and multiple forms are supported: the
  attributes are per-form, not a singleton. Kept visually quiet (sunken card,
  no shadow) so it reads as furniture beside the curriculum, not a second CTA
  competing with the lesson.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<aside class="mt-4 rounded-card border border-border bg-surface-sunken p-4">
  <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-heading text-sm font-extrabold text-ink">
    <i class="ph-fill ph-envelope-simple text-brand-500" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{t "New lessons by email"}}
  </p>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{{t "Get the next training lesson straight to your inbox, the moment I post it."}}</p>

  <form data-members-form="subscribe" class="mt-3">
    <input data-members-email type="email" required placeholder="{{t "you@example.com"}}" aria-label="{{t "Email address"}}"
           class="w-full rounded-btn border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-muted focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none">
    <button type="submit" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-btn bg-brand-500 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-600">
      <span data-members-loading class="hidden"><i class="ph ph-circle-notch animate-spin" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
      <span data-members-default>{{t "Subscribe"}}</span>
    </button>
    <p data-members-success class="mt-2 hidden text-xs font-semibold text-success">{{t "Check your inbox!"}}</p>
    <p data-members-error class="mt-2 hidden text-xs font-semibold text-error">{{t "Something went wrong — try again."}}</p>
  </form>
</aside>
